      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Haha...!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Do you think it's a lot better?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Haha... anyways, I am glad."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Come back with once in a while"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "with news from home."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Then byebye~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 39,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Eh!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "You are..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "You brought them!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Then, as I promised, I will teach you the skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "No need to worry about arrows now."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Oh, and did you happen to see"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 58,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "someone called Jason in Payon?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Be careful. He is a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "ferocious one."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "You just have to be careful of Jason in Payon."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Remember."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Then bubye~ Thank you for the presents~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "An archer in Morocc!?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Nice to see you! Meeting a fellow"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "archer in a place like this! *sniffsniff*!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I came alone to Morocc.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "but I was a newcomer, and the pressure... waaah~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I was very lonely~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "It must be hard. It's ok have faith."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Keep suffering."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Yes. Thank you..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "You must be having a hard"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "time in a place like this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Isn't it hard to find arrows?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "That's why I make my own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Eh, really?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Yeah! I gather different items"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "and make arrows using them."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 89,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "It is a useful skill to help me"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "survive alone in this tough world."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "If you'd like, I can teach you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "That would be wonderful."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 95,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "But.. I can't do it for free."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Nothing is free in this world~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Mmm... How about this?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "You bring me what I ask for."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Then I will teach you the skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I've been very lonely since I left my hometown."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I would like to treat my homesickness"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "with things from there."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Bring me 20 Resins from the trees in the "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Payon forest, and 1 Red Potion"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "sold in the store."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Also, 13 Trunks from the Willows that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "live near the Payon Forest,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "41 Pointed Scale,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "7 Mushroom Spores."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "If you bring me all of these,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I will teach you the skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Then.. I'll be waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "For news from our home."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "placeholders" : [
        "((Sex == SEX_MALE)?\"mister\":\"miss\")"
      ],
      "text" : "...hey {0}."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "...be careful at night."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[Roberto]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Hmm... Do you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "have something to say?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I have nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 132,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Difference in levels"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "cuts off conversations."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "[?]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Eh... First time seeing an archer or something?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Just go where you were going."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "I only talk to high level archers."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Roberto",
      "text" : "Won't open my mouth otherwise!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Eh, we meet again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Ehhhh so weird."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 150,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Whenever I see someone again"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "I start eh-ing a lot."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Ehhh... anyways nice to see you again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Ehhhh... don't come any more ehh..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Darn... my wound isn't healing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 159,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Bleh.. I was too careless... "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 160,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "to become like this.. err..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "But still, hurting me like this"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "giving me so many injuries..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "What should I do about Roberto."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Mmmm... Ah!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "You? How long have you been there?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Mmm... very high level."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 168,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Someone like you would definitely be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "able to know how to use Arrow Repel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "What is that?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Teach me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "...you're kidding, right?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Oh my, you don't even know"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Arrow Repel at that level?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "You're a strange person."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 179,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "(Jason was in the lala land.)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Well, ok. I'll teach you what"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Arrow Repel is."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Arrow Repel is a skill that allows you to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "push the opponent away as soon as you attack."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "You can only use it when you aim exactly"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "at the target. But unlike magic, "
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "it doesn't de-spell."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "It is very useful for an archer"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "that is weak in close ranges."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "If you would like to learn,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "come find me again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "There are some necessary materials."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 201,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "First, because you must modify a bow"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 202,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "bring a crossbow you do not use."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 203,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "10 Tentacles, 10 Bill of Birds,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "3 Yoyo Tails.. these are very elastic."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Also, 2 Emeralds. And last but not least..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "36 bottles of Banana Juice that I love!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "......Ehem!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "If you bring all of these,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 211,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "I shall teach you Arrow Repel."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 212,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Then, see you again."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 213,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "(I'm going to be mad if you don't bring the Banana Juice.)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Ok! Perfect!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "I shall teach you the nationally"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "renowned skill, Arrow Repel!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "[Jason]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Jason",
      "text" : "Oh, works better than I expected!"
    },
